# CKA Lab Exercise: User Authentication & RBAC

Hands-on exercise for defining Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) in Kubernetes.
Follows the exercise pattern from [bmuschko/cka-crash-course
(04-rbac)](https://github.com/bmuschko/cka-crash-course/tree/master/exercises/04-rbac).

